editorial:
### Debounce Solution

Maintain a `timer` variable in closure. On every invocation, `clearTimeout(timer)` cancels previous pending executions, and a new `setTimeout` is scheduled.

```js
function debounce(fn, delay) {
  let timer;
  return function(...args) {
    clearTimeout(timer);
    timer = setTimeout(() => fn.apply(this, args), delay);
  };
}
```

